      ["How big can a crew be?", "Whatever the situation calls for. Engagements match client needs, whether that is covering a single shift or deploying a multi-role crew across multiple sites."],
      ["Who supervises the workers?", "AFIMAC provides on-site supervision and a single point of contact, working alongside your team. A daily feedback loop tracks output, and the crew scales up or down as the situation changes."],
